{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49789","headline":"满宫花 · 张泌","name":"满宫花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花正芳，楼似绮，寂寞上阳宫里。\n钿笼金锁睡鸳鸯，帘冷露华珠翠。\n娇艳轻盈香雪腻，细雨黄莺双起。\n东风惆怅欲清明，公子桥边沈醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}